class.description:
Subclass this to store records in a file, in memory, or on a server.
[codeblock]
extends NetwDatabaseBackend

@export var root := "user://saves"

func _open(session: Object, slot: StringName) -> NetwPromise:
    return NetwPromise.resolved(MyConnection.new(root, slot))
[/codeblock]
A method left unimplemented rejects with [constant @GlobalScope.ERR_UNAVAILABLE]. The records themselves are read and written by the [NetwDatabaseConnection] that [method _open] returns.
